    <briefdescription>
<para>RAII wrapper for tracked resources. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Automatically increments/decrements counters for RAII testing.</para>
<para>Example: <programlisting filename=".cpp"><codeline><highlight class="normal">ResourceCounter<sp/>counter;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="classthemis_1_1utils_1_1testing_1_1_tracked_resource_1a21d6cd7a4a4c7849464ec040c6744647" kindref="member">TrackedResource&lt;int&gt;</ref><sp/>res(&amp;counter);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>EXPECT_EQ(counter.allocations(),<sp/>1);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">EXPECT_EQ(counter.deallocations(),<sp/>1);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
